  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Circular Economy in Central America</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of this action is to contribute to the transition towards a circular economy in Central America by converting three strategic material flows&#xbf;waste electrical and electronic equipment (e-waste), residual agricultural biomass, and post-consumer plastics&#xbf;into standards-compliant value chains with verified EU market access.</narrative>
  </description>
